{"id":5380,"date":"2025-10-01T11:16:03","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T01:46:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=5380"},"modified":"2025-10-15T16:27:49","modified_gmt":"2025-10-15T06:57:49","slug":"chatgpt-shopping-search-instant-checkout","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/chatgpt-shopping-search-instant-checkout\/","title":{"rendered":"ChatGPT Shopping Search &amp; Instant Checkout: How FeedOps Can Get You Ready"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"5380\" class=\"elementor elementor-5380\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6aec090 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6aec090\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f041167 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f041167\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">OpenAI has launched a new way for users to discover and buy products <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/chatgpt.com\/merchants\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">directly within ChatGPT <\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u2014 called ChatGPT Shopping Search.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This new capability lets users browse shoppable products powered by structured product data from participating merchants.\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">It\u2019s a major step forward in how consumers find and purchase products \u2014 and <strong>FeedOps<\/strong> is ready to help retailers prepare.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bed6068 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bed6068\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is ChatGPT Shopping Search?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e534519 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e534519\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fed272d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fed272d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ChatGPT Shopping Search brings ecommerce discovery into the conversation. Instead of jumping between search engines, marketplaces, and brand sites, users can now ask ChatGPT for product recommendations and get instant, shoppable results.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The system uses structured product data feeds \u2014 similar to those used in Google Merchant Center \u2014 to display accurate, up-to-date product information like titles, images, pricing, and availability.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For developers and merchants, OpenAI has released a detailed<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/developers.openai.com\/commerce\/specs\/feed\/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">commerce feed specification<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This outlines exactly how to format and submit product data so ChatGPT can display it accurately and interactively.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5cc6744 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5cc6744\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-217dc42 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"217dc42\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Customer-Care-Process-Improvements-1.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5385\" alt=\"ChatGPT Shopping\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Customer-Care-Process-Improvements-1.png 512w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Customer-Care-Process-Improvements-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Customer-Care-Process-Improvements-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6befe33 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6befe33\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47c3076 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"47c3076\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"729\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-01-at-7.52.08-AM-1024x933.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5386\" alt=\"Instant Checkout ChatGPT Shopping Interface\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-01-at-7.52.08-AM-1024x933.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-01-at-7.52.08-AM-300x273.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-01-at-7.52.08-AM-768x700.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-01-at-7.52.08-AM.png 1236w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6668313 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6668313\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>Instant Checkout (Currently U.S. Only)<\/b><\/h2><p><br \/><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A key part of this new feature is <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instant Checkout<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2014 a streamlined buying experience where users can complete purchases directly within ChatGPT.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019re new to feed optimization, our <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Google Shopping Feed Optimization Guide<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> explains how better product data drives visibility and sales across every channel.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At launch, Instant Checkout is only available in the United States and limited to selected merchants. However, as OpenAI expands access, having a compliant, optimized feed will make it much easier for brands outside the U.S. to onboard quickly when the feature becomes available.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9443999 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9443999\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>How FeedOps Helps<\/b><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps helps merchants prepare their product data for ChatGPT Shopping Search by optimizing and structuring feeds to meet OpenAI\u2019s specifications.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once your products are connected to FeedOps, you\u2019ll gain access to our full suite of Australian tools \u2014 including deep <\/span><b>product category optimization<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, <\/span><b>AI-enhanced title rewriting<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and <\/span><b>attribute enrichment<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to improve discoverability across all platforms.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We handle the technical setup so you can focus on growth:<\/span><\/p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Prepare your feed<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for OpenAI\u2019s specifications.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Optimize titles and categories<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> using AI to boost product visibility.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Generate a compliant feed<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ready for submission.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Guide you through submission<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> using OpenAI\u2019s merchant form.<\/span><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0df9a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0df9a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>Getting Started<\/b><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ChatGPT Shopping Search is still in its early stages, but it marks the start of a powerful new era for conversational commerce \u2014 one driven by structured, optimized product data.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you want your products to be ready for ChatGPT Shopping Search, <\/span><b>FeedOps can help you get there faster.<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For <\/span><b>existing customers<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, please reach out directly to your <\/span><b>account manager<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to get started. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For <\/span><b>new customers<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/contact-us\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> contact us here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to learn how FeedOps can prepare your product data for ChatGPT Shopping Search and beyond.<\/span><\/p><h4><strong>Let\u2019s make sure your feed is ready for ChatGPT\u2019s next big leap.<\/strong><\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4ab882 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f4ab882\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Frequently Asked Questions<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65dd5df e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"65dd5df\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fcfa612 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"fcfa612\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2650\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2650\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What is ChatGPT Shopping Search? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2650\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4fcb46 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c4fcb46\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58f226c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"58f226c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ChatGPT Shopping Search is OpenAI\u2019s new feature that lets users discover and buy products directly inside ChatGPT. It uses structured product data feeds to display shoppable results in a conversational format.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2651\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2651\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What is Instant Checkout? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2651\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12d11f1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"12d11f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8b7e16 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f8b7e16\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0Instant Checkout allows users to complete purchases inside ChatGPT without leaving the chat. It\u2019s currently available only in the United States for selected merchants, but global expansion is expected<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2652\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2652\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How can merchants participate in ChatGPT Shopping Search? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2652\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fda0d42 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fda0d42\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-090ef01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"090ef01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Merchants can prepare by creating a compliant product data feed following<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/developers.openai.com\/commerce\/specs\/feed\/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">OpenAI\u2019s commerce feed specification<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. FeedOps can help optimize and structure your product data so you\u2019re ready when OpenAI expands access.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2653\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2653\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What do I need before submitting my feed? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2653\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c038c06 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c038c06\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1329e3b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1329e3b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You\u2019ll need accurate product data (titles, descriptions, prices, and availability) formatted according to OpenAI\u2019s requirements. FeedOps can audit and optimize your data, ensuring it\u2019s compliant and performance-ready.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2654\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2654\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How can FeedOps help my business? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2654\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5db1cb1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5db1cb1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55e6fc3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55e6fc3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps connects, audits, and optimizes your product data to improve visibility and sales performance across all channels \u2014 including ChatGPT Shopping Search. We use AI to enhance titles, fill missing attributes, and structure feeds for better results.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Learn 7 best practices for Google Shopping product title optimization, including AI and long-tail strategies, to boost clicks, ROAS, and sales.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":5392,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[141],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5380","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-google-shopping-feed"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>ChatGPT Shopping Search &amp; Instant Checkout: How FeedOps Can Get You Ready<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"OpenAI launches ChatGPT Shopping Search. Learn how FeedOps helps merchants optimize product feeds and prepare for instant checkout expansion.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/chatgpt-shopping-search-instant-checkout\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"ChatGPT Shopping Search &amp; Instant Checkout: How FeedOps Can Get You Ready\" \/>